# Seed-corpus regression folder for fuzz-testing failures.
#
# Each JSON file in this directory is a failing input that was
# discovered by a fuzz test.  The corpus-replay test in the
# corresponding `.fuzz.test.ts` file reads these entries and
# replays them as ordinary unit tests so they are caught on
# every `npm test` run.
#
# To add a new entry manually, create a JSON file with the
# shape:  { "testName": "...", "input": <value>, "timestamp": <epoch> }
